und"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"12"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"23"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为标准算术模型；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a> 的公式类。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>可推导性和句子分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}\\)</span> 是下式定义的元语言可靠性谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\ (T\\vdash\\sigma\\Longrightarrow\\mathbb N\\models\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\ (T\\vdash\\sigma\\Longrightarrow\\mathbb N\\models\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 p.12 定义 Γ-sound，Theorem 2.1 用 Σ1-sound 排除 Gödel 句的否定。此处不把一般外部一致性误作 Σ1 可靠性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level"